First attempt (invalid — recorded for honesty): mutated by prepending
"// MUTATION: " to the 3 fix lines rather than deleting them. Since the
tests are plain substring/regex checks against the raw source text (the
widget has no export surface), a commented-out line still contains the
target substring and the mutation-test falsely showed 0 failures. Restored
from backup and redid the mutation correctly.

